 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Aquarium Does Not Dance"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "アクアリウムは踊らない"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Aquarium wa Odoranai"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Suze, a somber but caring girl, visits the Bianca Aquarium with her best friend Lulu in order to make use of a premium ticket that she has obtained by chance.\n\nWith the director's wife, Chris, guiding them through the aquarium, Suze and Lulu enjoy an extraordinary experience at the facility, until Lulu suddenly disappears.\n\nWhile exploring the aquarium in search of Lulu, Suze finds herself lost in a mysterious aquarium that looks a lot like the one she was in before...",
   "ja": "気だるげだが友達思いの少女・スーズは、ひょんなことから手に入れたプレミアムチケットを使うため、親友のルルと共に「ビアンカ水族館」を訪れる。\n\n館内を案内してくれる館長の妻・クリスのもと、水族館での非日常な体験を楽しむスーズたちだったが、ある時急にルルが行方をくらませてしまう。\n\nルルを捜して水族館を探索しているうちに、気付けばスーズは元いた水族館によく似た、謎の水族館に迷い込んでしまい――…。"
  },
